folder-thumbnailer - thumbnail icons for your directories

folder-thunmbnailer creates icons for your directories in thunar file
manager such that a directory is represented by an icon. It supports
JPEG, PNG and SVG so that if you have an icon theme (PNG or SVG) you can
place a desired icon to a directory in your HOME and that directory will
be a graphical representation of that directory. You can also make or
usec ustom PNG or SVG icon. Just rename the icon to folder.png or
folder.svg

JPEG is useful for album covers either named cover.jpg or folder.jpg
or hidden .folder.jpg. Use whatever name you music player requests.
Some use "folder", some use "cover".
